<title>USA: Kansas feedlot cattle roundup - USDA.</title>
<headline>Kansas feedlot cattle roundup - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DODGE CITY 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said trade was very slow late Tuesday. There were not enough slaughter steer or heifer sales confirmed for a market test at the close.</p>
<p>Inquiry was moderate, demand was light. Sales confirmed on 200 slaughter steers. For the week to date 9,300 head confirmed, mostly previously contracted or formulated cattle.</p>
<p>Steers - pen select with end choice 2-3 1275 lbs Brahma cross 71.00.</p>
<p>Confirmed: 200	week ago: 800	year ago: 38100</p>
<p>week to date: 9300  week ago: 23600    year ago: 49100</p>
